    ((SELECT id FROM easa_subjects WHERE code = 'M13.23'), 'Directional property is exhibited by', '[{"id": "a", "text": "the sense antenna", "correct": false}, {"id": "b", "text": "the loop antenna", "correct": true}, {"id": "c", "text": "both the sense and loop ant.nna", "correct": false}]'::jsonb, '{B2}'),
    ((SELECT id FROM easa_subjects WHERE code = 'M13.23'), 'In ADF system, Goniometer', '[{"id": "a", "text": "combines the signals from fixed loop antenna and sense antenna", "correct": false}, {"id": "b", "text": "effectively simulates a rotating loop antenna", "correct": true}, {"id": "c", "text": "alternately selects signals from loop antenna and sense antenna", "correct": false}]'::jsonb, '{B2}'),
    ((SELECT id FROM easa_subjects WHERE code = 'M13.23'), 'If voltage and frequency of the generator drop to zero in flight, it would be an indication that the', '[{"id": "a", "text": "CSD drives shaft had sheared", "correct": true}, {"id": "b", "text": "phase sequence detection circuit has operated", "correct": false}, {"id": "c", "text": "bus tie interlock is inoperative", "correct": false}]'::jsonb, '{B2}'),
    ((SELECT id FROM easa_subjects WHERE code = 'M13.23'), 'Assuming all systems are operating normally, as aircraft electrical load increases, generator output voltage will', '[{"id": "a", "text": "decrease and amperage output increases", "correct": false}, {"id": "b", "text": "increases and amperage output increases", "correct": false}, {"id": "c", "text": "remain constant and amperage output increases", "correct": true}]'::jsonb, '{B2}'),
    ((SELECT id FROM easa_subjects WHERE code = 'M13.23'), 'One of the main purposes of a CSD is to', '[{"id": "a", "text": "enable generators to be paralleled", "correct": true}, {"id": "b", "text": "prevent engine overload", "correct": false}, {"id": "c", "text": "maintain constant load on the generator", "correct": false}]'::jsonb, '{B2}'),
    ((SELECT id FROM easa_subjects WHERE code = 'M13.23'), 'in a undervolt condition in an AC generator system, the most likely consequence is', '[{"id": "a", "text": "activation of the time delay circuit", "correct": true}, {"id": "b", "text": "de-activation of the field regulatory TRs", "correct": false}, {"id": "c", "text": "energise the bus tie relay", "correct": false}]'::jsonb, '{B2}'),
